SUMMARY:OpenHack: Code together\, on anything
DESCRIPTION:Syracuse Software Development Meetup\nThe OpenHack elevator pi
 tch:\n\n* OpenHack is a casual social coding meetup with a simple purpose:
  Code together\, on anything.\n\nHow OpenHack works:\n\n* You can hack on 
 anything! Any language\, framework\, public/open-source\, personal project
 s\, client work… anything!\n* You don’t have to have an idea to hack o
 n\, you can come join someone else\n* We’ll kick things off with a quick
  round of introductions\, to say who you are\, what you’re working on\, 
 and if you’d like help with your idea\n* Food and drinks will be provide
 d\n* Feel free to join us - bring a laptop\, a project\, and a friend!\n\n
 We welcome local developers and designers of all skill levels\, interests\
 , ages genders\, you-name-it's to get together to write code or push pixel
 s. We’ll provide good food\, good people\, and creative energy.\n\nSee m
 ore at https://syracuse.io/groups/open-hack/\n\nWhat to bring\n\n* A lapto
 p if you're bringing a project\, but totally not required\n\nImportant to 
 know\n\n* Please review our Code of Conduct before attending: https://syra
 cuse.io/code-of-conduct/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/syracuse-software-development-meetup/
 events/315977415/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260804T182213Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260804T182213Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
